WEBVTT

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:22.910
Was it fun?

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:26.790
<i>Was it scary?</i>

00:00:28.610 --> 00:00:30.900
I have no idjea!

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:33.750
No "idjea" about what?

00:01:00.950 --> 00:01:05.250
HIGH SCHOOL DIVISION C  CLUB

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:08.610
I decided this myself

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:11.620
I decided that relying on chance

00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:17.130
is just so ridiculously fruitless

00:01:17.450 --> 00:01:22.100
I dwelled in my fantasies too much

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:28.070
I'm going to leave my safety zone behind

00:01:28.070 --> 00:01:32.940
The future is opening up to me like a vast river

00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:37.240
Even if sailing straight is difficult,

00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:40.570
I will hold my head high

00:01:41.450 --> 00:01:44.230
I'll change my life,

00:01:44.230 --> 00:01:47.270
and the gray rules that govern it

00:01:47.270 --> 00:01:53.130
even if I trip and stumble on the way

00:01:53.130 --> 00:01:59.050
Others are guiding me, but I will walk

00:01:59.050 --> 00:02:05.930
My footprints in this world are so colorful

00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:21.700
High School Division   Twelfth Grade   Kashima Sonora

00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:21.700
High School Division    Tenth Grade      Yamato Yura

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:27.540
I shall be your guard.

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:27.540
I shall be your guard.

00:02:22.610 --> 00:02:24.390
Sorry.

00:02:24.390 --> 00:02:26.780
I'm Kashima Sonora, 12th grade.

00:02:26.780 --> 00:02:28.330
Nice to meet you, Yurarin.

00:02:28.330 --> 00:02:31.040
Huh? How do you know...

00:02:31.640 --> 00:02:33.810
It's there on the plaque, right?

00:02:33.810 --> 00:02:35.470
I see...

00:02:35.470 --> 00:02:37.210
Gotten into the swing of things here?

00:02:38.440 --> 00:02:41.140
I've only just arrived.

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:44.580
Cool. Well, this is heaven.

00:02:44.580 --> 00:02:45.810
Enjoy it.

00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:57.530
D-Do you always shower this late?

00:02:57.530 --> 00:03:00.350
Nah, I just felt like it today.

00:03:00.350 --> 00:03:05.670
I rushed back from a tournament over in America.

00:03:07.060 --> 00:03:10.480
You know that feeling when your legs start itchin' on a plane?

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:13.110
I went for a jog to get rid of it.

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:15.530
You went jogging?

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:24.100
Those rice balls look tasty.

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:25.850
Can I have 'em?

00:03:26.690 --> 00:03:29.230
Oh, they're just leftovers from yesterday!

00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:30.380
They're probably gross!

00:03:30.380 --> 00:03:32.480
I'm diggin' in.

00:03:38.120 --> 00:03:39.330
H-Holy Jesus!

00:03:45.060 --> 00:03:46.910
<i>I see...</i>

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:51.730
<i>It melts like butter in my mouth, but it stays firm while in my hand!</i>

00:03:51.730 --> 00:03:53.750
<i>What exquisite craftsmanship!</i>

00:03:55.090 --> 00:03:56.420
<i>I am...</i>

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:58.380
holding it without molding it!

00:04:16.250 --> 00:04:17.780
Sir!

00:04:17.780 --> 00:04:20.580
Why do I only get to make rice balls?

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:32.250
Hey, sir! Listen to me!

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:36.990
Isn't this enough?

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:46.230
Nope.

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:51.640
This part is too firm and this one too soft.

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:54.310
You've got a ways to go before you can get one of these.

00:04:56.310 --> 00:04:58.330
One must hold them without molding them.

00:04:58.330 --> 00:05:01.480
Once you understand that, firing a gun will come naturally to you.

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:03.580
You will feel the gun.

00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:05.710
It will be soon, Sonora.

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:12.060
<i>The essence of holding a gun!</i>

00:05:12.060 --> 00:05:14.170
<i>Holding without molding.</i>

00:05:14.170 --> 00:05:18.460
<i>Did Yurari master this all on her own?</i>

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:21.400
Yurarin, do you have a teacher?

00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:23.220
A teacher?

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:27.520
Oh, sorry. Never mind.

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:31.630
Oh yeah, have you considered joining a club?

00:05:34.150 --> 00:05:36.690
I'm not really sure yet...

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:43.630
But some strange people with guns dragged me along and we shot at each other.

00:05:44.600 --> 00:05:47.230
I got shot in the end,

00:05:47.230 --> 00:05:51.310
but it kind of felt like I was on a real battlefield.

00:05:51.310 --> 00:05:52.950
It was amazing...

00:06:10.370 --> 00:06:11.930
It's all Kari's fault.

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:14.670
She scared Yuracchi off.

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:17.840
You think so?

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:21.020
Bunnyura looked like she was having fun.

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:22.790
Exactly!

00:06:22.790 --> 00:06:25.530
Besides, you all got carried away, too!

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:30.130
Either way, she's a fellow warrior now.

00:06:30.130 --> 00:06:32.370
It'll only take one more push to get her to join!

00:06:38.570 --> 00:06:40.600
Want to go angling for her with cake?

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:42.940
Didn't you do that the other day?

00:06:44.600 --> 00:06:47.090
No, there's only one choice we've got.

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:48.470
Which is?

00:06:49.850 --> 00:06:51.930
A suitcase of cash!

00:06:58.400 --> 00:06:59.360
How about it?

00:06:59.360 --> 00:07:00.890
Wanna join the C3 club?

00:07:01.200 --> 00:07:03.410
The C3 club?

00:07:05.180 --> 00:07:07.940
Those weird girls with guns...

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:11.260
Yeah. Those weird girls are the C3 club.

00:07:11.260 --> 00:07:13.290
And I'm their president.

00:07:13.290 --> 00:07:15.160
I-I'm sorry!

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:16.200
I...

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:17.400
Nah, don't sweat it.

00:07:17.400 --> 00:07:18.920
You hit the bullseye.

00:07:18.920 --> 00:07:20.040
So, what'd you think?

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:22.680
It felt like a real battlefield, right?

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:23.460
Was it fun?

00:07:24.360 --> 00:07:27.020
I suppose...

00:07:27.020 --> 00:07:28.640
So, wanna join?

00:07:30.480 --> 00:07:33.520
The welcoming ceremony for the new students is gonna start!

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:36.380
Hold on! Just let me drop off my luggage!

00:07:36.380 --> 00:07:38.120
Fine, catch up to me!

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:40.880
Hey, I thought we were friends!

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:47.520
It's not that I don't want to...

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:51.960
I just don't know if I could really get used to it.

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:55.070
I'd probably just annoy everyone...

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:00.790
Well, there are plenty of other clubs.

00:08:02.070 --> 00:08:03.740
Sorry.

00:08:03.740 --> 00:08:06.290
Well, since I finished off those delicious rice balls,

00:08:06.290 --> 00:08:08.800
I'm gonna go run around the block.

00:08:09.350 --> 00:08:10.670
Have fun.

00:08:11.200 --> 00:08:12.020
Later.

00:08:17.060 --> 00:08:19.110
She's running again...

00:08:24.360 --> 00:08:26.080
The C3 club...

00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:37.670
<i>Yamato Yura...</i>

00:08:50.400 --> 00:08:51.940
Sono!

00:08:51.940 --> 00:08:55.370
I hear you're Li'l Yura's roommate!

00:08:55.370 --> 00:08:56.830
How'd it go?

00:08:56.830 --> 00:08:58.350
Did you invite her into the club?

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:00.610
Do you think she'll sign up?

00:09:00.610 --> 00:09:02.220
I didn't do anything.

00:09:03.540 --> 00:09:07.190
Why the heck not? She's our best candidate!

00:09:07.850 --> 00:09:12.240
Do you have a plan, Sono?

00:09:12.240 --> 00:09:14.280
Nope, not at all.

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:16.540
Just wait and see.

00:09:16.540 --> 00:09:19.320
Hey, Sono!

00:09:19.320 --> 00:09:21.490
What now?

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:24.940
The time has come for drastic measures.

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:39.850
<i>Where will I eat my lunch?</i>

00:09:41.160 --> 00:09:43.050
Target sighted!

00:09:44.550 --> 00:09:45.480
Roger!

00:09:47.090 --> 00:09:50.880
Sorry! Would you be willing to fill out our questionnaire?

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:54.110
I wish to enter the aforementioned club

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:55.320
Stella Girls' Academy

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:57.120
Sure...

00:09:58.440 --> 00:10:00.490
Huh? Isn't this...

00:09:59.120 --> 00:10:00.490
club

00:09:59.120 --> 00:10:00.490
Stella Girls' Academy

00:09:59.120 --> 00:10:00.490
Club Signup

00:10:01.360 --> 00:10:02.750
She's gonna find out!

00:10:02.750 --> 00:10:03.870
Pull back!

00:10:05.740 --> 00:10:08.050
Thank you for your assistance!

00:10:13.060 --> 00:10:14.680
Me fortune teller of name!

00:10:14.680 --> 00:10:15.670
Free now!

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:19.260
You write name here, I tell fortune!

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:18.010
Name

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:17.970
Year

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:18.010
Class

00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:19.260
Stella Girls' Academy

00:10:19.970 --> 00:10:21.140
Thanks, but no thanks!

00:10:38.960 --> 00:10:41.200
Wait!

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:04.010
Why do they want someone like me?

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:12.270
<i>Is this the right choice?</i>

00:11:16.260 --> 00:11:18.990
<i>What was I doing there?</i>

00:11:31.550 --> 00:11:33.380
Got jetlag, Sono?

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:35.650
Why are you so unmotivated?

00:11:38.110 --> 00:11:41.120
Yachiyo and Rento are 10th graders,
and they're putting in effort,

00:11:41.120 --> 00:11:43.480
yet their president is taking a nap.

00:11:43.480 --> 00:11:44.990
It's a bit inconsiderate.

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:49.060
Um...

00:11:52.830 --> 00:11:54.430
Yurarin!

00:11:54.430 --> 00:11:56.880
Um... I'm sorry.

00:11:56.880 --> 00:11:58.850
Why are you apologizing?

00:11:58.850 --> 00:12:01.870
Well, for... a lot of things...

00:12:01.870 --> 00:12:04.300
What's "a lot" supposed to mean?

00:12:04.300 --> 00:12:06.640
This is why it's all your fault!

00:12:06.640 --> 00:12:10.520
We wouldn't be here if you'd told us straight up if you were joining or not!

00:12:11.430 --> 00:12:12.890
Well...

00:12:13.860 --> 00:12:16.230
Whose side are you on, Yuracchi?

00:12:16.760 --> 00:12:18.670
Um, I...

00:12:24.210 --> 00:12:25.620
Fine, whatever.

00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:27.280
Let's have a skirm.

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:29.410
You and Sono will be our enemies.

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:36.720
If you win, we won't press the issue any further.

00:12:36.720 --> 00:12:39.210
Sono won't badger you about it either.

00:12:41.760 --> 00:12:46.100
But if we win, you have to join our club.

00:12:46.100 --> 00:12:50.680
And Sono will have to clean her gun wearing only this as her punishment.

00:12:56.930 --> 00:12:57.540
Um...

00:12:57.540 --> 00:12:58.900
Sounds fun.

00:12:59.530 --> 00:13:00.760
We're game.

00:13:01.460 --> 00:13:03.940
But I haven't said anything!

00:13:03.940 --> 00:13:05.030
Think you can take us?

00:13:06.820 --> 00:13:10.120
It's four against two.
Sure you don't need a handicap?

00:13:10.120 --> 00:13:11.410
Say what?

00:13:11.410 --> 00:13:12.510
All right...

00:13:12.510 --> 00:13:16.650
I'll win without holding a gun, then.

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:18.590
Bare-handed?

00:13:18.590 --> 00:13:20.960
I see! A VIP skirm!

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:24.570
I don't really understand what's going on...

00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:26.220
This seems all kinds of wrong.

00:13:26.220 --> 00:13:27.510
We're cool.

00:13:27.510 --> 00:13:29.540
You'll be protecting me, after all.

00:13:29.540 --> 00:13:31.220
What? I will?

00:13:31.220 --> 00:13:34.300
Yep. You'll be my bodyguard.

00:13:34.300 --> 00:13:39.840
But I don't know what I'm supposed to do or when to...

00:13:41.230 --> 00:13:42.860
Trust me.

00:13:43.820 --> 00:13:44.770
Okay!

00:13:50.880 --> 00:13:54.870
For today's skirm, Sono will be VIP, and Yura will be her bodyguard.

00:13:54.870 --> 00:14:29.410
Today's Airsoft Skirm

00:13:55.440 --> 00:13:57.180
We'll be within the old school building.

00:13:57.180 --> 00:13:59.360
The VIP and her bodyguard will start on the third floor.

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:03.200
They will win if they reach the building entrance.

00:14:03.200 --> 00:14:07.990
Meanwhile, we'll win if we manage to hit the VIP.

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:09.340
Capiche?

00:14:09.340 --> 00:14:14.630
Um... so, I have to protect her and mount an escape.

00:14:14.630 --> 00:14:18.940
Escape's one ticket to victory, but wiping them out is another.

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:25.310
There are stairs in the center and on the eastern and western sides.

00:14:25.310 --> 00:14:28.370
However, you can't use the same stairway multiple times.

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:32.870
Good. Now that we've got the rules straightened out...

00:14:32.870 --> 00:14:36.120
why do I have to wear this?

00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:38.670
That's the VIP dress.

00:14:38.670 --> 00:14:40.720
We've always done it like this.

00:14:40.720 --> 00:14:43.750
Good grief, it looks bad on you.

00:14:44.300 --> 00:14:45.920
Ouch!

00:14:45.920 --> 00:14:47.260
All right!

00:14:47.690 --> 00:14:50.010
The school bell will ring in five minutes!

00:14:50.010 --> 00:14:52.000
That'll be the go signal.

00:14:52.510 --> 00:14:54.000
Let the match begin!

00:14:59.020 --> 00:15:03.020
Old School Building
Third Floor Eastern Corridor

00:15:12.990 --> 00:15:19.000
Old School Building
First Floor Entrance

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:26.860
Okay, release the safety.

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:28.010
L-Like this?

00:15:28.010 --> 00:15:29.100
Yes.

00:15:29.100 --> 00:15:31.010
If you fire now—

00:15:38.460 --> 00:15:40.160
Careful there.

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:40.940
Okay, let's go!

00:15:40.940 --> 00:15:44.060
I can't! I can't!

00:15:44.060 --> 00:15:45.440
Wait here.

00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:48.110
Don't stop! Fill the air with bullets!

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:49.800
Come here!

00:15:58.160 --> 00:15:59.000
Yurarin!

00:16:00.050 --> 00:16:01.280
Take a look.

00:16:03.180 --> 00:16:04.460
It's just pictures.

00:16:05.470 --> 00:16:07.750
You'll probably be out of bullets soon...

00:16:11.140 --> 00:16:12.380
so use this.

00:16:12.380 --> 00:16:14.410
I'm gonna go first.

00:16:15.060 --> 00:16:19.970
When you go down the stairway ahead, just hide in the first classroom you see.

00:16:19.970 --> 00:16:20.930
So long.

00:16:46.680 --> 00:16:47.920
No way.

00:16:48.420 --> 00:16:50.200
Hit!

00:16:50.200 --> 00:16:52.420
<i>So, Yachiyo failed.</i>

00:16:58.310 --> 00:16:59.810
Why are you coming up again?!

00:17:00.360 --> 00:17:01.480
Bullets!

00:17:03.700 --> 00:17:05.850
All right. Let's take the western stairway.

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:13.940
So, which window will it be?

00:17:13.940 --> 00:17:18.360
There's no way Sono would take the stairs like a mere mortal.

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:21.500
Huh?

00:17:28.130 --> 00:17:29.800
I see you!

00:17:37.920 --> 00:17:39.610
Are they toying with me?

00:17:48.480 --> 00:17:49.150
Oh, no!

00:17:49.150 --> 00:17:49.940
Oh, no!

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:53.670
Hit.

00:17:56.300 --> 00:17:58.410
Great job! They hit each other!

00:17:58.910 --> 00:18:00.580
It was a fluke.

00:18:12.110 --> 00:18:13.130
All right.

00:18:13.130 --> 00:18:16.170
The last one is our ace, Karira.

00:18:16.170 --> 00:18:17.730
Let's surrender!

00:18:17.730 --> 00:18:19.940
She's crazy good!

00:18:19.940 --> 00:18:22.670
Now the party's really gettin' started!

00:18:35.290 --> 00:18:36.570
You've arrived.

00:18:37.900 --> 00:18:38.950
The mole strategy?

00:18:44.300 --> 00:18:46.710
Hold on! Is that allowed?

00:18:49.680 --> 00:18:52.680
I'm pretty sure there's a hole next to the entrance too.

00:18:53.270 --> 00:18:54.950
We'll break through there.

00:18:54.950 --> 00:18:57.010
That's kind of a cheap strategy.

00:18:58.050 --> 00:19:00.180
They'll force you into the club if you lose.

00:19:00.180 --> 00:19:01.650
Are you okay with that?

00:19:02.820 --> 00:19:05.170
This place is kind of dirty...

00:19:05.170 --> 00:19:06.390
And there might be bugs...

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:13.150
She thought of...

00:19:13.150 --> 00:19:14.610
the same thing!

00:19:39.720 --> 00:19:41.050
Shoot, Yurarin!

00:19:44.140 --> 00:19:45.640
I can't move!

00:19:47.060 --> 00:19:48.220
This is the end.

00:19:55.390 --> 00:19:58.370
I won't let you get away!

00:20:03.310 --> 00:20:05.270
I can't do it!

00:20:05.270 --> 00:20:08.110
Your rice balls were great.

00:20:09.470 --> 00:20:12.290
Guns are just like rice balls.

00:20:12.290 --> 00:20:14.420
Don't think about it.

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:19.510
Sonora...

00:20:19.980 --> 00:20:21.580
Call me Sono.

00:20:23.130 --> 00:20:24.050
But...

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:29.090
I know you can do it, Yurarin.

00:20:31.570 --> 00:20:32.240
Okay.

00:20:36.190 --> 00:20:38.180
Ready, aim...

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:42.450
Hit!

00:20:51.200 --> 00:20:55.150
So you figured out my plan, huh?

00:20:55.150 --> 00:20:58.480
Well, didn't I saw open the other hole to begin with?

00:20:57.460 --> 00:21:00.570
Sono should really be more empathic.

00:21:00.570 --> 00:21:03.950
She really isn't the type to lose on purpose.

00:21:03.950 --> 00:21:05.750
You've really gotten good, Karira.

00:21:05.750 --> 00:21:09.220
You still waste bullets and spray like no tomorrow,

00:21:09.220 --> 00:21:12.650
but your combat maneuvers have gotten phenomenal.

00:21:12.650 --> 00:21:14.230
Did you lose weight?

00:21:16.230 --> 00:21:18.900
So, what'll be your reward?

00:21:18.900 --> 00:21:21.610
Yeah, the other day...

00:21:39.450 --> 00:21:41.840
I'll join the club.

00:21:44.220 --> 00:21:45.800
I'll join the club!

00:21:47.540 --> 00:21:48.690
Really?

00:21:48.690 --> 00:21:50.560
But you won.

00:21:51.230 --> 00:21:54.060
This is my decision.

00:22:10.000 --> 00:22:10.900
Command!

00:22:11.580 --> 00:22:12.780
Control!

00:22:13.240 --> 00:22:15.030
Communication!

00:22:15.030 --> 00:22:16.100
The C3 Club!

00:22:16.100 --> 00:22:16.600
Yay!

00:22:16.600 --> 00:22:19.920
Survival doesn't make the gunshots stop

00:22:19.920 --> 00:22:23.280
Carrying the flag I hear gunfire

00:22:23.280 --> 00:22:28.380
Smile, 'cause isn't this fun?

00:22:28.380 --> 00:22:30.460
Yay!

00:22:31.620 --> 00:22:36.630
I blush when I make eye contact with my comrade,

00:22:36.630 --> 00:22:38.440
but that's fine

00:22:38.440 --> 00:22:41.570
Let's trust each other and laugh

00:22:41.570 --> 00:22:42.560
Ready?

00:22:43.130 --> 00:22:45.080
3, 2, 1, go! Go!

00:22:45.080 --> 00:22:48.110
Take your comrade and get the flag!

00:22:48.110 --> 00:22:51.830
Can't you feel your heart thump when you advance?

00:22:51.830 --> 00:22:54.910
Let's hit them and laugh

00:22:54.910 --> 00:22:55.820
All right?

00:22:56.490 --> 00:22:58.460
3, 2, 1, go! Go!

00:22:58.460 --> 00:23:01.790
It can be hard, it can be vexing,

00:23:01.790 --> 00:23:04.620
but when you overcome that

00:23:04.940 --> 00:23:11.730
you'll smile like you never did before

00:23:11.730 --> 00:23:13.450
Everyone, take up positions!

00:23:13.450 --> 00:23:13.970
Okay!

00:23:13.800 --> 00:23:14.370
Okay!

00:23:14.210 --> 00:23:14.710
Okay!

00:23:14.370 --> 00:23:14.840
Okay!

00:23:14.580 --> 00:23:15.140
Okay!

00:23:14.960 --> 00:23:18.260
Survival doesn't make the gunshots stop

00:23:18.260 --> 00:23:21.590
Carrying the flag I hear gunfire

00:23:21.590 --> 00:23:27.000
Enjoy your youth, even if your tears are stolen

00:23:28.220 --> 00:23:31.700
Telepathy, a step forward

00:23:31.700 --> 00:23:34.770
Don't look down, look ahead

00:23:34.770 --> 00:23:39.190
Sorry it took me so long to be enthusiastic about it!

00:23:39.670 --> 00:24:09.490
Preview

00:23:40.660 --> 00:23:43.000
Airsoft means curry!

00:23:43.000 --> 00:23:44.630
Vegetables in soy sauce are nice too.

00:23:44.630 --> 00:23:45.940
Leek is best!

00:23:45.940 --> 00:23:47.220
Boiled eggs or nothing!

00:23:47.220 --> 00:23:48.780
I need no topping.

00:23:48.780 --> 00:23:52.300
All I wish for is rice with seasoning.

00:23:52.300 --> 00:23:53.850
I see. And you, Yachiyo?

00:23:53.850 --> 00:23:55.150
I want pork cutlet!

00:23:55.150 --> 00:23:56.350
The meat from domestic black pigs!

00:23:56.350 --> 00:23:57.820
Isn't that curry from cutlet?!

00:23:57.820 --> 00:23:58.820
And you, Yurara?

00:23:58.820 --> 00:24:02.650
I want... everything you girls are having!

00:24:02.650 --> 00:24:03.630
Next episode.

00:24:02.850 --> 00:24:09.690
Do the enemy bullets break even your spirit?

00:24:03.630 --> 00:24:05.940
Do the enemy bullets break even your spirit?

00:24:05.940 --> 00:24:06.940
The entire world!
